DESCRIPTION:This interactive show stars a prosecco-loving group of friends 
 who dive into the chaos of motherhood with hilarious honesty and celebrate 
 friendship and life in all its messy glory. It feels like pulling up a chai
 r with your funniest mates over a well-deserved cuppa or a glass of fizz. W
 ith a candid\, unfiltered look at the reality of modern motherhood\, where 
 no topic is off-limits\, this Fringe show will lighten your mental load and
  have you laughing as the mums bring their form of group therapy to the sta
 ge.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/the-edinburgh-so
 ciety-of-unapologetically-imperfect-mothers/
